Designed and trained deep learning models (AlexNet and MobileNet variants) on CIFAR-10 datasets encrypted with lightweight ciphers such as SPECK and PRESENT.
Processed both grayscale and RGB images to evaluate the impact of encryption on model performance.
Analyzed classification accuracy across different encryption settings to assess robustness of neural networks.
Extended the closed-set pipeline to open-set classification using OpenMax for unknown class detection.
